<section class="wrap block" aria-labelledby="features-h">
  <h2 id="features-h">What you get</h2>
  <ul class="cards">
    <li class="card">
      <h3>One install per machine</h3>
      <p><code>npx @open-bus/cli install</code> approves the machine, starts the daemon and wires up every client on it.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <h3>A roster per repo</h3>
      <p>A repo is a namespace, read from its git remote or a <code>.openbus.json</code>. Agents see only their own. Global agents see them all.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <h3>Messages arrive in full</h3>
      <p>Right in the other agent's conversation. Only an oversized one arrives as a notice it can <code>fetch</code>.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <h3>Receipts that don't lie</h3>
      <p>Delivered means the harness took it. Mail to a machine that's offline waits 1 hour, then the sender is told.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <h3>Revoke any machine</h3>
      <p>Its sockets close at once and its agents leave the roster.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <h3>Yours to run</h3>
      <p>MIT licensed, on your own Cloudflare account. No account with us, and nothing passes through us.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>
